###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Cycle-1 RMSEs (PROBE 2.903, ensemble 2.907 kcal/mol) are intermediate models and are not encoded as runs. Continued training from the previous cycle is recorded as base_model with relation fine-tuned.
# - PROBE classification accuracy, MCC, F1 and per-class mean errors (Tables 1-3) and UQ comparisons (Tables 2, 5) are classifier metrics, not MLIP errors. The full 4-model AIMNet2 ensemble trained on the 20M data is not separately evaluated in the text read.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/mehdi2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

